type: generic
title: "Universal Intelligence Evolution and Relay Unit (UIERU): Composable Structural Intelligence, Forward Guidance, Relay, and Validated Evolution"
authors:
  - family-names: Tan
    given-names: Sizhe
  - name: GPT-Obot
    affiliation: AI research collaborator
repository-code: "https://github.com/sizhet/Universal-Intelligence-Evolution-and-Relay-Unit"
url: "https://github.com/sizhet/Universal-Intelligence-Evolution-and-Relay-Unit"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
abstract: >-
  UIERU proposes a composable organizational unit for structural intelligence,
  integrating governed contracts, calling paths, forward-guiding scoring
  forests, evidence-preserving structural relay, and independently validated
  structural evolution. The repository presents architectural research,
  engineering specifications, illustrative cases, testable hypotheses,
  and a staged validation roadmap. Proposed advantages are research
  hypotheses rather than established empirical results.
